---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Cover Letter — Hans Al Koch (HAK)"
  description="Cover letter for Hans Al Koch (HAK) — Director of Agent Optimization. Cloudflare: Chief Agent (CFA)."
  ogType="article"
  ogUrl="https://hansakoch.com/cover-letter"
>
  <a href="https://hansakoch.com/" style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:24px;color:var(--accent-dim);font-size:0.9rem;">← hansakoch.com</a>

  <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:12px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);">Hans Al Koch</h1>
  </div>
  <p style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.85rem;margin-bottom:8px;">Director of Agent Optimization · Cloudflare: Chief Agent (CFA)</p>
  <p style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:8px;">
    <a href="tel:+447441900339" style="color:var(--text);">+44 7441 900 339</a> · <a href="mailto:hans@hansakoch.com" style="color:var(--text);">hans@hansakoch.com</a>
  </p>
  <p style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.85rem;margin-bottom:32px;">
    <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/hansakochcom" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">linkedin.com/in/hansakochcom</a> ·
    <a href="https://github.com/hansakoch" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">github.com/hansakoch</a>
  </p>
  <hr style="border:none;border-top:2px solid var(--accent);margin:0 0 28px 0;">

  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;">Dear Hiring Manager,</p>

  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;">I build agents that stay up. OpenRoyleAl runs on Cloudflare Workers, D1, Vectorize, and Durable Objects — Linux and Android nodes, 6-second average latency, 63+ secrets in D1. OpenClaw since January 2025 (18.7K stars then, 361K+ now).</p>

  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;">Iceberg Media is 14 years of UK SEO. I am pivoting the shop to agents: Cloudflare-first across 98+ domains, 168 Google Business Profiles, teams of 10+.</p>

  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;">Cloudflare Agent Memory — persistent recall over HTTP — lives at <a href="https://github.com/hansakoch/cf-memory-plugin" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">cf-memory-plugin</a>. I would welcome the chance to talk.</p>

  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;">Best regards,</p>
  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;"><strong>Hans Al Koch (HAK)</strong></p>

  <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:32px;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted);">
    <p>🖨️ <em>Print-friendly — Ctrl+P to save as PDF</em></p>
    <p style="margin-top:8px;"><a href="/resume" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">📄 Resume</a> · <a href="/cv" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">📋 Full CV</a> · <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">📬 Contact</a></p>
  </div>

  <style>
    @media print {
      body { background: white !important; color: #111 !important; }
      h1 { color: #111 !important; }
      hr { border-color: #111 !important; }
      a { color: #111 !important; text-decoration: none !important; }
      .container { padding: 0 !important; max-width: 100% !important; }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
